<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dēstructĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				pulling down, destruction</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">murorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Galb. 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">munitionum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 2
					Cor. 10, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sententiarum (opp. confirmatio),</span>”
				<i>a refuting, refutation</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 5, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">appetentiae,</span>”
				<i>disturbance</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cael.
						Aur. Acut. 3, 21, 203</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
